1
00:01:37,770 --> 00:01:43,060
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,150 --> 00:01:43,690
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:45,690
[Episode 4]

4
00:01:46,870 --> 00:01:48,509
47 years ago,

5
00:01:49,229 --> 00:01:51,590
the Great Shi Dynasty wiped out Liluo.

6
00:01:51,710 --> 00:01:53,570
Their crimes were unforgivable.

7
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:56,039
Tianmoluo took root here

8
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:58,840
by the will of the God Kelu.

9
00:01:59,310 --> 00:02:02,370
It will feed on the lifeblood
of children from Great Shi

10
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:05,040
to bear the fruit of vengeance.

11
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,120
Wen Nansheng.

12
00:02:16,430 --> 00:02:17,470
I get it now.

13
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:19,680
The killer first murdered Master Sun,

14
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:21,710
then killed Wen Nansheng.

15
00:02:21,710 --> 00:02:22,710
He took the lower half of

16
00:02:22,710 --> 00:02:23,960
Wen Nansheng's body

17
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,910
and mixed it with the upper half

18
00:02:25,910 --> 00:02:27,190
of Master Sun's.

19
00:02:27,470 --> 00:02:29,120
Master Sun's lower body

20
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:31,400
and Wen Nansheng's upper body

21
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:32,680
fit together perfectly

22
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:34,079
to make one whole corpse.

23
00:02:34,470 --> 00:02:36,150
Corpses,

24
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,680
puppets—

25
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,310
they're nothing but

26
00:02:39,310 --> 00:02:41,400
lifeless things.

27
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:43,840
The only fate waiting for them

28
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,590
is decay.

29
00:02:46,950 --> 00:02:48,829
I hate decay.

30
00:02:48,900 --> 00:02:50,950
I hate death.

31
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:54,350
Look at God Kelu.

32
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:55,870
Never rots,

33
00:02:56,030 --> 00:02:57,490
never dies.

34
00:02:57,590 --> 00:02:59,079
Isn't that wonderful?

35
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:02,630
You drain blood to make cursed incense,
harm young girls,

36
00:03:02,630 --> 00:03:03,630
kidnap children…

37
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:04,910
and you killed Wen Nansheng

38
00:03:04,910 --> 00:03:06,030
and Master Sun.

39
00:03:06,150 --> 00:03:07,680
Why? Why did you do all this?

40
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:12,810
You're all going to die anyway.

41
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:14,870
Might as well tell you.

42
00:03:16,470 --> 00:03:19,400
Kelu, the great god
of the ancient Liluo Sect,

43
00:03:19,910 --> 00:03:22,630
rules over all growth and life.

44
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:25,890
When he takes the form of Tianmoluo,

45
00:03:26,310 --> 00:03:28,910
he can bear the fruit of immortality.

46
00:03:30,190 --> 00:03:33,860
Eat it, and you stay young forever,

47
00:03:33,890 --> 00:03:35,740
never aging, never dying.

48
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:40,030
For the fruit to ripen fully,

49
00:03:40,870 --> 00:03:43,030
I need the pure yang energy

50
00:03:43,030 --> 00:03:44,920
of 36 children

51
00:03:45,079 --> 00:03:49,480
to nourish Tianmoluo's dark yin body.

52
00:03:52,910 --> 00:03:54,520
You kidnapped all those children

53
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:56,320
just to feed this evil creature?

54
00:03:56,910 --> 00:03:57,910
I understand now.

55
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:59,470
Young boys possess pure yang essence.

56
00:03:59,470 --> 00:04:01,520
Between the ages of 6 and 13,

57
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,840
as their kidney energy awakens,

58
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:04,080
they lose their baby teeth
and grow new ones.

59
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:04,840
Their inner vital energy

60
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,150
is at its peak.

61
00:04:06,630 --> 00:04:08,030
No wonder all the kidnapped kids

62
00:04:08,030 --> 00:04:09,560
were the ones losing their teeth.

63
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,710
You keep chanting

64
00:04:10,710 --> 00:04:12,280
"God Kelu is above us all."

65
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:13,470
But in my eyes,

66
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,120
all this talk

67
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,290
just means you're afraid to die

68
00:04:17,450 --> 00:04:19,480
and crave immortality.

69
00:04:22,070 --> 00:04:23,560
Am I wrong,

70
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,390
Master Coroner Wen?

71
00:04:33,830 --> 00:04:34,720
Li Qingyang.

72
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,159
That's not Wen Nansheng.

73
00:04:36,159 --> 00:04:37,570
He's just a human puppet.

74
00:04:37,830 --> 00:04:39,560
Lady Fragrance was the puppet.

75
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:42,830
And Wen Nansheng never died at all.

76
00:04:44,070 --> 00:04:45,630
He knew your autopsy skills
were unmatched,

77
00:04:45,630 --> 00:04:47,750
Master Coroner Bai.

78
00:04:48,070 --> 00:04:48,950
So

79
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:50,830
he cut off the legs of

80
00:04:50,830 --> 00:04:52,480
someone with rheumatism

81
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:53,750
to throw us off.

82
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,630
He wanted

83
00:04:55,830 --> 00:04:57,920
to fake Wen Nansheng's death.

84
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:00,430
Look at how swollen the legs are—

85
00:05:00,430 --> 00:05:01,720
that's rheumatism,

86
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:04,070
from years of working in
damp, dark places.

87
00:05:04,070 --> 00:05:06,330
And the jade pendant left on the clothes…

88
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:08,090
it must belong to Wen Nansheng.

89
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:09,360
Earlier,

90
00:05:10,070 --> 00:05:11,270
he was speaking to us

91
00:05:11,270 --> 00:05:12,530
using ventriloquism.

92
00:05:12,830 --> 00:05:13,560
Pretending to be

93
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:15,000
a mindless human puppet—

94
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,830
it was all just an illusion.

95
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,160
Wen Nansheng.

96
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:20,480
Why did you kill Master Sun?

97
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,370
Dougu County isn't big,

98
00:05:26,510 --> 00:05:27,920
but searching house by house

99
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:29,450
for kids losing their teeth

100
00:05:29,630 --> 00:05:31,270
would take too long.

101
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,950
Chunfeng Hall treats people

102
00:05:33,950 --> 00:05:35,560
with toothaches all the time.

103
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:36,600
So I figure

104
00:05:37,070 --> 00:05:38,510
you got the list

105
00:05:38,510 --> 00:05:40,640
of teething children from Master Sun.

106
00:05:40,750 --> 00:05:41,630
That's why

107
00:05:41,870 --> 00:05:43,390
you killed Master Sun—

108
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:45,830
to silence him.

109
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:48,070
But if Master Sun had kept quiet,

110
00:05:48,070 --> 00:05:49,830
nothing would have been exposed.

111
00:05:49,830 --> 00:05:50,920
Why risk everything

112
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,120
by killing Master Sun

113
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:53,630
and drawing our investigation?

114
00:05:53,630 --> 00:05:55,950
Children in the county have been
going missing one after another.

115
00:05:55,950 --> 00:05:57,480
Right at this time,

116
00:05:57,830 --> 00:05:59,159
Master Sun's daughter,

117
00:05:59,159 --> 00:06:00,240
Yuyao, who just lost her baby teeth,

118
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,390
also disappeared.

119
00:06:01,830 --> 00:06:03,390
Master Sun didn't know

120
00:06:03,510 --> 00:06:04,600
that Yuyao was actually

121
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:05,950
kidnapped by bandits.

122
00:06:05,950 --> 00:06:09,160
He thought Wen Nansheng was too greedy

123
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:11,630
and killed his daughter.

124
00:06:11,870 --> 00:06:13,400
You were partners in crime.

125
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:15,140
Then you turned on each other.

126
00:06:15,270 --> 00:06:16,160
Wen Nansheng…

127
00:06:16,310 --> 00:06:18,680
you killed Lady Fragrance too, didn't you?

128
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:19,480
To steal

129
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,340
the Dead Bone Spice from her shop.

130
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:39,630
That woman locked the door

131
00:06:40,090 --> 00:06:42,159
thinking I couldn't get in.

132
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:44,040
But I got in anyway…

133
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:48,040
and killed her with one stab.

134
00:06:53,070 --> 00:06:53,870
And then

135
00:06:55,700 --> 00:06:59,200
her cowardly brother

136
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:00,830
just went mad.

137
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:08,070
How did you get inside?

138
00:07:08,070 --> 00:07:09,070
Seize him first.

139
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:10,870
Take him back. Interrogate slowly.

140
00:07:10,870 --> 00:07:11,680
Stop!

141
00:07:17,070 --> 00:07:18,190
Come any closer,

142
00:07:18,270 --> 00:07:19,920
and I'll kill Yuyao.

143
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:27,310
The Divine Constable Bureau,

144
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:30,160
solving cases by using
a little girl as bait?

145
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:33,120
What kind of heroes are you?

146
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,040
Wen Nansheng,

147
00:07:37,070 --> 00:07:38,830
Tell me—who

148
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,630
put you up to all this?

149
00:07:40,630 --> 00:07:42,600
And who taught you

150
00:07:43,070 --> 00:07:45,010
the puppetry to control puppet doll?

151
00:07:45,010 --> 00:07:46,150
Want to know?

152
00:07:47,710 --> 00:07:49,890
Ask me in your next life.

153
00:08:05,890 --> 00:08:06,770
What's heck?

154
00:08:09,510 --> 00:08:10,480
What's heck?

155
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:12,040
My little Hua Erbao.

156
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:13,570
You've done well.

157
00:08:15,950 --> 00:08:16,750
What,

158
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:18,830
only you get to use tricks and illusions?

159
00:08:18,830 --> 00:08:20,240
I can't play along too?

160
00:08:22,950 --> 00:08:24,830
So you never actually used Yuyao as bait.

161
00:08:24,830 --> 00:08:26,040
Lord Constable Ghost,

162
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:28,680
Yuyao is safe and sound

163
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:30,340
at Mrs. Hua's house right now.

164
00:08:30,850 --> 00:08:33,400
You have gone too far!

165
00:09:22,670 --> 00:09:23,670
My lords.

166
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,270
These puppet dolls,

167
00:09:25,270 --> 00:09:26,840
although their moves are marvelous,

168
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:28,440
are just mechanisms after all.

169
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:29,500
Perhaps,

170
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:31,720
if we hold on for a few more moves,

171
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:33,510
their moves will repeat.

172
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,270
A few moves?

173
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:38,480
You'll find out once you fight.

174
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:39,150
You!

175
00:10:23,490 --> 00:10:24,510
Trying to run?

176
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,330
Now you know

177
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:54,130
why I killed the coroner.

178
00:10:56,660 --> 00:10:59,050
-I want his face.
-How was the scent theft

179
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:01,100
in the sealed chamber pulled off?

180
00:11:01,150 --> 00:11:03,910
The truth’s out now, isn’t it?

181
00:11:04,030 --> 00:11:05,270
Others couldn't get in.

182
00:11:05,270 --> 00:11:06,320
He is a dwarf,

183
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:08,570
so he could crawl through the dog hole.

184
00:11:14,870 --> 00:11:16,230
The Divine Constable Bureau searched
all over Tianhuang City

185
00:11:16,230 --> 00:11:17,630
for a three-foot puppet.

186
00:11:17,630 --> 00:11:18,600
But in fact,

187
00:11:18,750 --> 00:11:19,770
there is no such thing as

188
00:11:19,770 --> 00:11:20,970
a three-foot puppet.

189
00:11:21,090 --> 00:11:22,310
From beginning to end,

190
00:11:22,310 --> 00:11:24,200
there was only you, a dwarf.

191
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:25,840
This is called shrinking
a dragon into inches,

192
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:27,330
an innate immortal body.

193
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:28,660
So that's how it is.

194
00:11:29,270 --> 00:11:30,200
No wonder he harmed

195
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:31,930
so many girls in Tianhuang City

196
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,000
but was never brought to justice.

197
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:35,440
As long as the dwarf's main body
wasn't found,

198
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:37,080
he just needed to use other corpses

199
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:38,360
to make puppet doll

200
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:39,550
as a smokescreen.

201
00:11:41,530 --> 00:11:42,960
Great God of Kelu,

202
00:11:42,990 --> 00:11:44,720
please show your miracle.

203
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:45,440
Get rid of

204
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:46,870
these three heretics who dared disturb

205
00:11:46,870 --> 00:11:48,080
your slumber.

206
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:49,630
So-called God Kelu…

207
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,000
You've told so many lies

208
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:52,800
you even believe them yourself.

209
00:12:02,260 --> 00:12:04,370
God Kelu has manifested!

210
00:12:25,750 --> 00:12:27,750
Meng Rui, Heaven-Measuring Ruler.

211
00:12:36,750 --> 00:12:39,550
Arrogant Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation!

212
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:20,210
Mr. Meng.

213
00:14:07,630 --> 00:14:08,440
Li Qingyang.

214
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:09,200
Li Si.

215
00:14:10,550 --> 00:14:11,390
I'm fine.

216
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:20,960
Wen Nansheng!

217
00:14:21,190 --> 00:14:23,330
-Surrender now!
-My flowers!

218
00:14:27,200 --> 00:14:27,960
Great…

219
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:30,520
God Kelu, Tianmoluo…

220
00:14:30,750 --> 00:14:31,910
destroyed by

221
00:14:31,910 --> 00:14:33,090
your hands…

222
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:35,400
Do you not fear divine retribution?

223
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:39,340
My Tianmoluo…

224
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:43,900
God Kelu…

225
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:46,790
help me.

226
00:15:01,870 --> 00:15:04,240
Those who do evil will destroy themselves.

227
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:05,030
Ms. Bai.

228
00:15:05,670 --> 00:15:06,480
Mr. Meng

229
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:08,420
hurry and save the people.

230
00:15:16,130 --> 00:15:18,680
[Dougu County Office]

231
00:15:16,750 --> 00:15:18,360
The children are all dead!

232
00:15:18,910 --> 00:15:19,870
My lord, my lord!

233
00:15:19,160 --> 00:15:25,400
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

234
00:15:19,870 --> 00:15:21,910
Our child can't die for nothing!

235
00:15:21,910 --> 00:15:22,630
My lord!

236
00:15:22,670 --> 00:15:23,790
My lord!

237
00:15:24,550 --> 00:15:25,360
My lord!

238
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:28,030
I'm Cuicui's father!

239
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:29,240
This is… Cuicui!

240
00:15:29,040 --> 00:15:30,780
[Enter the County Office
to Examine Oneself]

241
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:30,150
My daughter is Cuicui!

242
00:15:30,150 --> 00:15:31,240
My lord, my lord!

243
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:33,150
I'm Youyou's mother! My lord!

244
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:36,270
Give us justice!

245
00:15:35,010 --> 00:15:36,700
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

246
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:42,550
I, Li, am humble.

247
00:15:42,570 --> 00:15:44,450
Today I ask Mr. Du

248
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:45,610
to bear witness.

249
00:15:46,270 --> 00:15:48,960
Here is five thousand taels of silver.

250
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:50,910
One hundred taels as compensation
for each family.

251
00:15:49,140 --> 00:15:49,570
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

252
00:15:50,910 --> 00:15:51,910
That's too much…

253
00:15:52,550 --> 00:15:54,120
There were only about thirty children.

254
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:55,030
The rest

255
00:15:55,150 --> 00:15:57,680
I shall donate entirely
to the county office.

256
00:15:58,790 --> 00:15:59,600
Good.

257
00:16:00,150 --> 00:16:00,790
Is that acceptable?

258
00:16:00,790 --> 00:16:01,150
Yes.

259
00:16:01,150 --> 00:16:02,120
Then why don't you say it?

260
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:03,120
Good, good, good.

261
00:16:04,510 --> 00:16:06,310
Let them come collect the money.

262
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:08,510
Everyone may approach.

263
00:16:08,510 --> 00:16:09,960
Stop! Do not enter!

264
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:11,480
Don't rush! Don't fight!

265
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:12,960
Who dares disrupt the court?

266
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:14,490
You—give it to me first!

267
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:15,200
Let go!

268
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:16,200
Don't fight!

269
00:16:17,910 --> 00:16:18,720
Give it to me! Give it to me!

270
00:16:18,720 --> 00:16:19,670
Everyone gets their share.

271
00:16:19,670 --> 00:16:20,480
Out of my way!

272
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:22,750
I was first!

273
00:16:22,750 --> 00:16:23,600
Don't fight!

274
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:25,000
Protect me!

275
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:25,870
My lord!

276
00:16:25,910 --> 00:16:26,960
My lord! My lord!

277
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:27,670
No fighting!

278
00:16:27,670 --> 00:16:29,130
No fighting! No fighting!

279
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:31,910
No fighting!

280
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:33,440
Hold it tight!

281
00:16:33,870 --> 00:16:35,790
Hurry and register them!

282
00:16:36,390 --> 00:16:37,910
No one's registered yet!

283
00:16:37,940 --> 00:16:38,720
Stop standing around! Move!

284
00:16:38,720 --> 00:16:39,510
You unruly people!

285
00:16:39,510 --> 00:16:40,360
Don't leave!

286
00:16:40,440 --> 00:16:41,410
Don't leave!

287
00:16:41,510 --> 00:16:43,430
Give back my silver!

288
00:16:43,750 --> 00:16:45,270
You like eating chicken, don't you?

289
00:16:45,270 --> 00:16:46,550
Eat all you want this time.

290
00:16:46,550 --> 00:16:47,600
Write it all down!

291
00:16:47,600 --> 00:16:48,390
Write it down!

292
00:16:48,390 --> 00:16:49,650
Every last one of them!

293
00:16:58,870 --> 00:17:01,000
Really? A hundred taels for real?

294
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:04,069
So much money!

295
00:17:06,720 --> 00:17:08,200
Father! Mother!

296
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:09,750
I'm home!

297
00:17:11,790 --> 00:17:13,349
Mother!

298
00:17:13,349 --> 00:17:14,680
Father!

299
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:15,790
Mother!

300
00:17:15,790 --> 00:17:16,589
Youyou!

301
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:17,670
Mother!

302
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:21,349
Father, my feet hurt.

303
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:23,550
Father, Mother!

304
00:17:23,210 --> 00:17:25,180
[Noble Righteousness]
[Law Enforced Unwaveringly]

305
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:26,240
Mother, I'm hungry.

306
00:17:28,109 --> 00:17:30,070
-Father! Father!
-Mother.

307
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:32,110
I'm scared.

308
00:17:32,270 --> 00:17:33,180
-Father.
-Mother.

309
00:17:33,180 --> 00:17:34,640
Father!

310
00:17:34,790 --> 00:17:37,070
Father! Father!

311
00:17:38,270 --> 00:17:39,110
Sir,

312
00:17:39,590 --> 00:17:41,000
didn't the children all die?

313
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,970
Mother, I'm so scared.

314
00:17:43,270 --> 00:17:45,000
Alright, let's go. Let's go. Let's go.

315
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:45,920
Hurry home.

316
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:47,240
Strange…

317
00:17:47,400 --> 00:17:48,110
These parents

318
00:17:48,110 --> 00:17:49,920
were weeping bitterly just now.

319
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:51,920
Why have they suddenly changed faces?

320
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:52,680
It's almost as if

321
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:54,210
they were putting on an act.

322
00:17:55,070 --> 00:17:56,680
Could it be the children
weren't really taken?

323
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:57,680
Or…

324
00:17:57,790 --> 00:17:58,960
the ones taken

325
00:17:58,960 --> 00:18:00,820
weren't even their own children?

326
00:18:03,030 --> 00:18:03,830
Yuyao,

327
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:05,960
can you point out to me

328
00:18:06,350 --> 00:18:07,480
which one among them

329
00:18:07,750 --> 00:18:09,200
is Cuicui's father?

330
00:18:11,720 --> 00:18:13,650
Sesame cakes! Fresh sesame cakes!

331
00:18:14,110 --> 00:18:15,120
Sesame cakes!

332
00:18:15,270 --> 00:18:16,610
Sesame cakes!

333
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:19,030
Two copper each!

334
00:18:21,270 --> 00:18:22,110
Let's go.

335
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:25,480
Young master, come buy a cake!

336
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:26,480
Two copper each!

337
00:18:32,470 --> 00:18:33,270
Mister,

338
00:18:33,790 --> 00:18:34,510
answer just one question,

339
00:18:34,510 --> 00:18:36,110
and this silver ingot is yours.

340
00:18:36,110 --> 00:18:38,880
Ask away.

341
00:18:39,030 --> 00:18:39,830
Is Niu Cuicui

342
00:18:40,110 --> 00:18:43,240
your own flesh and blood?

343
00:18:46,590 --> 00:18:48,110
-Father.
-Mother!

344
00:18:48,510 --> 00:18:49,510
-Mother!
-Mother!

345
00:18:49,510 --> 00:18:50,790
Father! Father!

346
00:18:50,790 --> 00:18:52,650
Mother! Mother!

347
00:18:52,680 --> 00:18:53,880
I missed you so much, Mother!

348
00:18:53,880 --> 00:18:55,350
Mother!

349
00:18:55,720 --> 00:18:56,550
Yuanbao!

350
00:18:59,320 --> 00:19:00,520
[Noble Righteousness]
[Law Enforced Unwaveringly]

351
00:19:00,110 --> 00:19:01,110
Yuanbao.

352
00:19:01,110 --> 00:19:02,240
-Yuanbao!
-Mother!

353
00:19:02,550 --> 00:19:03,420
Mother!

354
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:05,240
-Yuanbao.
-I miss you.

355
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:05,960
my child!

356
00:19:05,960 --> 00:19:07,640
I missed you!

357
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:09,110
I missed you too.

358
00:19:09,110 --> 00:19:10,200
Are you alright?

359
00:19:20,880 --> 00:19:21,940
Fellow villagers,

360
00:19:22,110 --> 00:19:23,310
the reunion of family

361
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:25,720
is the greatest joy under heaven.

362
00:19:26,400 --> 00:19:27,480
In that case,

363
00:19:28,680 --> 00:19:29,550
Mr. Du,

364
00:19:30,510 --> 00:19:32,590
I ask you to take back

365
00:19:32,750 --> 00:19:34,480
all this compensation silver.

366
00:19:36,500 --> 00:19:38,010
Get away from me!

367
00:19:38,110 --> 00:19:39,370
She's not my daughter!

368
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:41,330
Father!

369
00:19:41,480 --> 00:19:42,440
Get out!

370
00:19:42,510 --> 00:19:43,310
Don't call me that!

371
00:19:43,310 --> 00:19:44,200
Mother!

372
00:19:44,270 --> 00:19:46,000
Mother, I'm sorry.

373
00:19:46,110 --> 00:19:46,920
What are you doing?

374
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:48,000
Are you insane?

375
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:49,310
It's a hundred taels of silver.

376
00:19:49,310 --> 00:19:50,270
Let's go! Let's go home!

377
00:19:50,270 --> 00:19:50,960
Let go!

378
00:19:52,070 --> 00:19:53,130
Who's your mother?

379
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:54,160
Mother!

380
00:19:54,160 --> 00:19:54,750
I don't know you!

381
00:19:54,750 --> 00:19:55,720
Let go, do you hear me?

382
00:19:55,720 --> 00:19:56,880
Let's go! Back home!

383
00:19:57,960 --> 00:19:59,270
Father!

384
00:20:00,030 --> 00:20:00,830
Father!

385
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:03,240
Father!

386
00:20:03,480 --> 00:20:04,270
Hurry!

387
00:20:04,550 --> 00:20:05,350
Get back!

388
00:20:06,110 --> 00:20:07,710
Shame on you, being a father!

389
00:20:08,070 --> 00:20:09,160
Have you no conscience?

390
00:20:09,160 --> 00:20:10,880
Your heart's been eaten by dogs!

391
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:11,350
What are you doing?

392
00:20:11,350 --> 00:20:12,750
Even if Youyou isn't your own daughter,

393
00:20:12,750 --> 00:20:13,510
would you really abandon

394
00:20:13,510 --> 00:20:14,270
all affection

395
00:20:14,270 --> 00:20:15,720
just for a hundred taels?

396
00:20:15,720 --> 00:20:16,510
Shrew!

397
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:18,310
Spouting nonsense and shouting in court!

398
00:20:18,310 --> 00:20:19,750
Guards! Silence her!

399
00:20:19,750 --> 00:20:20,160
Yes!

400
00:20:20,160 --> 00:20:21,670
Mother! Mother!

401
00:20:23,310 --> 00:20:24,790
Mother!

402
00:20:29,830 --> 00:20:30,640
Mrs. Hua,

403
00:20:31,750 --> 00:20:32,830
you said earlier

404
00:20:33,590 --> 00:20:35,250
Youyou isn't her birth child.

405
00:20:36,310 --> 00:20:37,110
Why not

406
00:20:37,790 --> 00:20:39,450
tell us everything in detail.

407
00:20:44,920 --> 00:20:46,550
It's all this corrupt official Du Yi'an!

408
00:20:46,550 --> 00:20:48,000
You abducted all these children

409
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:48,790
and left them with us to raise.

410
00:20:48,790 --> 00:20:49,510
Dare you deny it?

411
00:20:49,510 --> 00:20:50,350
Shut up!

412
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:51,580
Get out of here.

413
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:52,680
Shut up.

414
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:53,680
All those thirty-odd children

415
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:54,720
who went missing in this county—

416
00:20:54,720 --> 00:20:56,070
including our Yuanbao,

417
00:20:56,200 --> 00:20:56,880
and the kids

418
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:58,480
from other families in town—

419
00:21:00,110 --> 00:21:01,550
none of them are our own.

420
00:21:06,110 --> 00:21:07,070
Seven years ago,

421
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:08,880
the neighboring county
was hit by a locust plague.

422
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:10,310
Many people had nothing to eat.

423
00:21:10,310 --> 00:21:11,000
So they fled

424
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:12,730
to Dougu County to beg for food.

425
00:21:13,350 --> 00:21:15,310
Adults could go hungry for a few days,

426
00:21:15,310 --> 00:21:16,480
but these little ones

427
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:17,610
suffered terribly.

428
00:21:19,550 --> 00:21:20,480
Some were

429
00:21:20,480 --> 00:21:21,880
even newborns.

430
00:21:22,590 --> 00:21:25,070
How could their mothers feed
them with no milk?

431
00:21:25,070 --> 00:21:26,440
We could only watch

432
00:21:28,680 --> 00:21:30,000
helplessly

433
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:31,960
as the children starved to death.

434
00:21:35,590 --> 00:21:36,830
Then this crooked official,

435
00:21:36,830 --> 00:21:37,680
Du Yi'an,

436
00:21:38,030 --> 00:21:39,480
came along.

437
00:21:39,480 --> 00:21:40,750
He bought children

438
00:21:40,750 --> 00:21:42,000
with a few soybean cakes,

439
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:43,160
then handed those kids over
to young couples like us

440
00:21:43,160 --> 00:21:44,440
to raise.

441
00:21:44,960 --> 00:21:47,030
That's right, it's true!

442
00:21:47,070 --> 00:21:48,480
I was trying to save them from starving!

443
00:21:48,480 --> 00:21:49,880
I was saving people from misery!

444
00:21:49,880 --> 00:21:51,270
I was doing good deeds!

445
00:21:51,270 --> 00:21:52,030
Bah!

446
00:21:52,530 --> 00:21:53,440
You just wante

447
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:54,400
to raise these kids

448
00:21:54,400 --> 00:21:56,030
to use them for yourself!

449
00:21:56,440 --> 00:21:57,400
Divine Constable,

450
00:21:57,400 --> 00:21:58,400
ever since

451
00:21:58,440 --> 00:21:59,970
the children went missing,

452
00:22:00,030 --> 00:22:02,200
this corrupt official not only
refused to investigate

453
00:22:02,200 --> 00:22:03,750
but also paid people to keep
their mouths shut.

454
00:22:03,750 --> 00:22:04,590
He said

455
00:22:04,640 --> 00:22:06,350
if anyone breathed a word,

456
00:22:06,350 --> 00:22:07,480
he'd kill them.

457
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:11,590
Ask them!

458
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:14,070
Go on, tell them!
L-Lord Constable,
you see?
This shrew is spreading lies!
Talking nonsense!

459
00:22:14,070 --> 00:22:15,240
Tell them!

460
00:22:15,240 --> 00:22:16,000
You guys...

461
00:22:17,790 --> 00:22:18,880
L-Lord Constable,

462
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:20,070
you see?

463
00:22:20,440 --> 00:22:21,550
This shrew is spreading lies!

464
00:22:21,550 --> 00:22:23,350
-She’s talking nonsense.
-I...

465
00:22:24,590 --> 00:22:25,440
Mr. Meng,

466
00:22:25,440 --> 00:22:26,070
you are

467
00:22:26,070 --> 00:22:28,130
a high official from Tianhuang City.

468
00:22:28,370 --> 00:22:29,880
This corrupt dog Du Yi'an

469
00:22:29,880 --> 00:22:32,590
abducted innocent children.
He's utterly inhumane!

470
00:22:32,590 --> 00:22:34,200
You must uphold justice

471
00:22:34,200 --> 00:22:35,680
for these poor children

472
00:22:35,680 --> 00:22:37,030
of Dougu County!

473
00:22:37,030 --> 00:22:37,960
My lord! My lord!

474
00:22:41,550 --> 00:22:42,440
Mr. Du,

475
00:22:43,680 --> 00:22:45,070
you may not have known

476
00:22:45,160 --> 00:22:47,290
about Wen Nansheng and the Tianmoluo.

477
00:22:47,590 --> 00:22:48,880
But Wen Nansheng

478
00:22:49,030 --> 00:22:51,000
worked in the county office.

479
00:22:51,830 --> 00:22:53,680
If he wanted to take the children,

480
00:22:53,680 --> 00:22:54,880
he could fool others,

481
00:22:55,240 --> 00:22:57,170
but he could never hide it from you.

482
00:22:59,830 --> 00:23:00,680
I suspect

483
00:23:01,830 --> 00:23:03,550
you made a deal:

484
00:23:04,830 --> 00:23:07,070
once the children reached
the age of losing their teeth,

485
00:23:07,070 --> 00:23:09,830
Wen Nansheng would bribe you with silver.

486
00:23:10,350 --> 00:23:11,160
And you

487
00:23:11,790 --> 00:23:14,030
would look the other way.

488
00:23:18,000 --> 00:23:19,200
You thought

489
00:23:19,790 --> 00:23:22,200
these children weren't their real kids,

490
00:23:22,960 --> 00:23:23,750
so you

491
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:26,640
could settle everything with money later.

492
00:23:27,680 --> 00:23:29,480
But you never expected

493
00:23:29,680 --> 00:23:30,480
this case

494
00:23:31,590 --> 00:23:33,850
would draw the Divine Constable Bureau.

495
00:23:39,020 --> 00:23:39,870
Mr. Meng,

496
00:23:40,680 --> 00:23:41,640
if you search

497
00:23:41,680 --> 00:23:43,000
Mr. Du's mansion

498
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:44,190
right now,

499
00:23:44,240 --> 00:23:46,370
you will find a huge fortune in bribes.

500
00:23:56,200 --> 00:23:57,000
My lord,

501
00:23:57,160 --> 00:23:59,030
Dougu County is far from the capital.

502
00:23:59,030 --> 00:24:00,350
The whole county

503
00:24:00,350 --> 00:24:01,680
answers only to you.

504
00:24:01,680 --> 00:24:02,440
Why fear some constable?

505
00:24:02,440 --> 00:24:03,550
Am I right, folks?

506
00:24:03,590 --> 00:24:04,640
Don't you think so, everyone?

507
00:24:04,640 --> 00:24:05,160
Yeah!

508
00:24:05,160 --> 00:24:06,880
-Yeah!
-Exactly!

509
00:24:06,880 --> 00:24:07,680
Why should we be afraid of him?

510
00:24:07,680 --> 00:24:08,550
-Right!
-Exactly!

511
00:24:08,550 --> 00:24:10,270
To cut off a man's wealth
is like killing his parents.

512
00:24:10,270 --> 00:24:11,270
Who cares about some Divine Constable?

513
00:24:11,270 --> 00:24:12,830
We have the silver in our hands.

514
00:24:12,830 --> 00:24:13,830
We're not afraid of him.

515
00:24:13,830 --> 00:24:14,750
Yeah, not afraid!

516
00:24:14,750 --> 00:24:16,080
Not afraid! Not afraid!

517
00:24:22,270 --> 00:24:23,070
That's right.

518
00:24:24,550 --> 00:24:27,030
I am the upright magistrate of Dougu!

519
00:24:28,590 --> 00:24:29,830
I won't be pushed around

520
00:24:29,830 --> 00:24:31,680
by the two of you!

521
00:24:35,720 --> 00:24:36,510
Guards!

522
00:24:36,830 --> 00:24:37,280
Yes!

523
00:24:37,310 --> 00:24:38,070
-Yes!
-Yes!

524
00:24:43,680 --> 00:24:44,790
So that's

525
00:24:45,550 --> 00:24:47,200
where the bandits went.

526
00:24:48,680 --> 00:24:51,080
You've been colluding with them all along.

527
00:24:52,640 --> 00:24:53,480
Du Yi'an

528
00:24:54,790 --> 00:24:57,990
how dare you call yourself
the upright official of Dougu?

529
00:25:07,950 --> 00:25:13,410
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

530
00:25:10,200 --> 00:25:11,400
For money,

531
00:25:12,480 --> 00:25:13,680
you sell children.

532
00:25:14,350 --> 00:25:15,750
You tear apart families.

533
00:25:16,400 --> 00:25:20,340
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

534
00:25:16,590 --> 00:25:17,680
As parents,

535
00:25:18,200 --> 00:25:18,920
have you

536
00:25:18,920 --> 00:25:20,650
ever felt even a shred of guilt?

537
00:25:22,480 --> 00:25:24,480
You talk about silver in your hands.

538
00:25:26,260 --> 00:25:30,900
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

539
00:25:27,270 --> 00:25:29,200
Open your eyes and look!

540
00:25:29,350 --> 00:25:31,030
What are you really holding?

541
00:25:36,940 --> 00:25:37,330
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

542
00:25:37,890 --> 00:25:38,410
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

543
00:25:38,790 --> 00:25:39,590
This...

544
00:25:38,970 --> 00:25:39,970
[Clear as a Mirror]

545
00:25:40,160 --> 00:25:40,750
Where is the money?

546
00:25:40,750 --> 00:25:41,510
My money.

547
00:25:41,830 --> 00:25:43,550
What's going on?

548
00:25:43,550 --> 00:25:44,810
Why is it yellow paper?

549
00:25:45,350 --> 00:25:46,750
My money! It's gone!

550
00:25:46,880 --> 00:25:47,790
It's gone.

551
00:25:47,790 --> 00:25:48,680
Where is my money?

552
00:25:48,680 --> 00:25:49,640
The money is gone.

553
00:25:49,640 --> 00:25:50,640
Where is my money?

554
00:25:51,030 --> 00:25:52,200
My money is gone.

555
00:25:52,880 --> 00:25:54,550
My money.

556
00:25:55,270 --> 00:25:56,240
My money.

557
00:25:58,000 --> 00:26:00,400
What am I going to do?

558
00:26:00,400 --> 00:26:02,270
A hundred taels!

559
00:26:02,420 --> 00:26:06,680
[Clear as a Mirror]

560
00:26:02,980 --> 00:26:05,750
♪ Capture my heart ♪

561
00:26:05,270 --> 00:26:07,400
My money

562
00:26:06,460 --> 00:26:09,440
♪ Unravel my longing ♪

563
00:26:07,400 --> 00:26:08,880
Give me back my money

564
00:26:08,720 --> 00:26:12,200
[Clear as a Mirror]

565
00:26:10,330 --> 00:26:16,100
♪ Can we relive the mark you
once carved deep ♪

566
00:26:12,830 --> 00:26:13,760
Father Emperor…

567
00:26:14,350 --> 00:26:16,400
You still have the cricket
you made for me.

568
00:26:16,400 --> 00:26:18,350
But your son Yan'er is dead.

569
00:26:16,450 --> 00:26:19,670
♪ Turns out every soul ♪

570
00:26:16,640 --> 00:26:20,550
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

571
00:26:19,480 --> 00:26:21,680
You never cleared his name.

572
00:26:20,230 --> 00:26:23,460
♪ Fears deep devotion ♪

573
00:26:22,270 --> 00:26:23,270
Do you ever

574
00:26:24,160 --> 00:26:26,160
feel even a little guilty?

575
00:26:24,530 --> 00:26:30,680
♪ Fall in love in a blink,
then fade to dust thin ♪

576
00:26:30,920 --> 00:26:33,920
♪ Dare not forget ♪

577
00:26:31,210 --> 00:26:35,280
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

578
00:26:34,930 --> 00:26:37,840
♪ No regret, no blame ♪

579
00:26:38,650 --> 00:26:44,850
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

580
00:26:43,400 --> 00:26:44,880
Greed devours the heart.

581
00:26:45,810 --> 00:26:47,550
Loyalty and love are worth less than mud.

582
00:26:47,320 --> 00:26:51,390
♪ Forever within your shadow
by your side ♪

583
