Fine, fine, I'll tell you.

648
00:31:27,880 --> 00:31:29,680
It was always Wen Nansheng.

649
00:31:31,200 --> 00:31:32,070
Tong County,

650
00:31:32,070 --> 00:31:33,400
Dougu County—all of it.

651
