667
00:32:51,330 --> 00:32:53,260
Don't come any closer!

668
00:32:54,880 --> 00:32:57,030
Don't come any closer!

669
00:32:59,750 --> 00:33:01,010
Don't come any closer!

670
00:33:01,480 --> 00:33:03,030
Go away! Go away!

671
00:33:03,050 --> 00:33:04,050
