737
00:36:32,280 --> 00:36:33,480
A rest wouldn't hurt.

738
00:36:37,670 --> 00:36:38,930
Lord Constable Frost,

739
00:36:39,190 --> 00:36:40,230
you should know

740
00:36:40,440 --> 00:36:41,440
these

741
00:36:41,740 --> 00:36:43,250
cannot hold me.

742
00:36:43,440 --> 00:36:44,150
We've tried everything these days.

743
00:36:44,150 --> 00:36:45,590
Young Master Qingyang's

744
00:36:46,330 --> 00:36:48,610
