750
00:36:57,070 --> 00:36:58,000
No need.

751
00:36:59,570 --> 00:37:01,740
Please, take a seat, both of you.

752
00:37:07,760 --> 00:37:09,230
Master, long time no see.

753
00:37:09,360 --> 00:37:10,150
