800
00:39:34,440 --> 00:39:35,150
Good!

801
00:39:36,460 --> 00:39:37,520
Well said!

802
00:39:37,590 --> 00:39:38,800
Very well said!

803
00:39:39,750 --> 00:39:41,410
Splendidly said!

804
00:39:43,990 --> 00:39:45,230
Though it's a branch,

805
00:39:45,280 --> 00:39:47,410
