840
00:41:26,840 --> 00:41:28,240
This is Young Master Wen.

841
00:41:44,260 --> 00:41:45,130
Leave!

842
00:41:49,510 --> 00:41:50,400
All of you, out!

843
00:41:51,550 --> 00:41:52,280
Out! Out! Out!

844
00:41:52,280 --> 00:41:52,590
Get out!

845
00:41:52,590 --> 00:41:53,110
Out! Out! Out!

846
00:41:53,110 --> 00:41:55,710
