867
00:42:39,000 --> 00:42:40,070
Go! Go! Hurry!

868
00:42:40,110 --> 00:42:41,370
Let's go.

869
00:42:42,800 --> 00:42:43,710
Young Master Wen.

870
00:42:43,710 --> 00:42:44,360
Out! Out! Out!

871
00:42:44,360 --> 00:42:45,880
Anyone staying at
the Star-Gathering Pavilion

872
00:42:45,880 --> 00:42:47,800
