874
00:42:49,190 --> 00:42:49,980
Hurry up!

875
00:42:51,940 --> 00:42:55,570
If you don't leave, you'll be dead.

876
00:43:00,030 --> 00:43:00,930
The dead

877
00:43:01,480 --> 00:43:03,080
can hardly be called guests.

878
00:43:04,240 --> 00:43:05,470
Hurry! Don't dawdle!

879
00:43:05,500 --> 00:43:07,750
-I’ll count to three.
-Keep up. Hurry!

880
00:43:08,000 --> 00:43:09,070
1.

881
00:43:09,350 --> 00:43:11,010
Move over there!

882
00:43:11,670 --> 00:43:12,480
2.

883
00:43:17,190 --> 00:43:18,000
Who dares?

884
00:43:21,650 --> 00:43:28,390
[Divine Constable Tally]

885
00:43:22,230 --> 00:43:23,360
By the law of the Great Shi,

886
00:43:23,360 --> 00:43:25,280
anyone who wields weapons openly

887
00:43:25,280 --> 00:43:26,440
and runs rampant in broad daylight

888
00:43:26,440 --> 00:43:27,320
shall be flogged 50 times

889
00:43:27,320 --> 00:43:28,630
and imprisoned for three months.

890
00:43:28,630 --> 00:43:30,830
It's the Divine Constable Bureau seal.

891
00:43:39,510 --> 00:43:40,480
Well, well.

892
00:43:40,710 --> 00:43:42,070
You're a girl from this inn, aren't you?

893
00:43:41,810 --> 00:43:43,100
[Divine Constable Tally]

894
00:43:43,320 --> 00:43:45,670
Not bad looking.

895
00:43:52,070 --> 00:43:54,150
This is interesting.

896
00:43:57,320 --> 00:43:59,150
Your Star-Gathering Pavilion

897
00:43:59,250 --> 00:44:01,250
is quite creative.

898
00:44:01,670 --> 00:44:03,110
Come on, untie him.

899
00:44:03,280 --> 00:44:04,920
Chain yourself to me.

900
00:44:05,190 --> 00:44:06,760
Tonight, I am

901
00:44:06,760 --> 00:44:08,670
going to have some fun with you.
